[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mPolling (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mClient asks every ~30s. Trivial to build, works everywhere. Bell can be up to 30s stale.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Server-sent events
     [38;5;246mNear-instant, one-way push over plain HTTP. More moving parts: connection lifecycle, reconnects, proxy buffering.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m WebSockets
     [38;5;246mNear-instant and bidirectional. Most infrastructure for a feature that only needs one direction.[39m
